    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A deep rumbling sound crawls into my ears and begins to violate my insides.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It churns them, as if I’m being sodomized by the whispers of demons.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The noise turns my blood to semen and, within a matter of minutes, my organs cease to function.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Just kidding.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This doesn’t happen.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I feel fine.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "How do you feel?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "menu:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Me?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Yes, you.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m talking to you.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I can see you. Just as you see me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "We all see each other.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But, for some reason, we can’t see what matters most.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "menu:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What matters most?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "God, of course.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Without him, you and I wouldn’t be here.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But he’s dead now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Such a tragedy!",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Who else will we pray to?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Who else will we call upon when our loved ones are on their death beds?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Who else will we ask to forgive us of our misdeeds in exchange for momentary salvation?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "“Please, God! I will never sin again if you just X!”",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And so he X.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And you continue to sin.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Why do you lie?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene friends1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/friends1.webp",
      "alt": "friends1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We lie because it makes things easier!",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is the point of living if we need to follow rules?",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene howifeel1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/howifeel1.webp",
      "alt": "howifeel1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes! Yes! Rules are bad!",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We lie because it feels good!",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Throw yourself into the wishing well!",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The happiest place in the world!",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rejoice! We are finally free!",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Two angels appear before me. Their voices remind me of a long lost friend.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Her name begins with the letter T.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": こんにちは",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh. You’re here too?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She has always been here! Truly a wonderful girl!",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes! Yes! A normal [teenage]girl!",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": 普通の女子高生。",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you need help?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You are the one who stumbled in here by mistake.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Unless-",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You came to pray?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, mistakes! No! He has come with ill intent!",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes! Yes! He is here for forgiveness!",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Forgiveness? But I haven’t done anything wrong.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Incest! He commits [incest]! A sin!",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Horrible!",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Castration!",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Crucify the sinner!",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": sssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rebirth is a sin!",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Suicide is a sin!",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Remove his arms!",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Feed him to 望む!",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes! Yes! Then he can be forgiven!",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": sssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssssss",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The two angels let loose a series of horrible heavenly noises.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "One hisses while the other chatters his teeth.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "All the while, a biomechanical machine stirs in the background.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Its tendrils plug the insides of a girl I can not see. I can only guess who it is.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t worry about me.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have been through much worse than this.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": あなたなしで毎日。。。",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The girl cries!",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Coward!",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She wants to go home!",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Coward!",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "They mention her crying, but her voice is steady and unshaken.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "\"Which is surprising because, from here, it appears that her organs are being",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "dematerialized.\"",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "How can such a small body curve around and envelop such a horrible thing?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The man becomes aroused!",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He wants to fuck the girl!",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is...",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is this true?...",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You still want to fuck me?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": After all you’ve seen?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "My mouth fills with blood and I’m unable to respond.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Slowly and painfully, I can feel my teeth beginning to liquify.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Everything spills out of my mouth at once.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hahahahahahahahaha!",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": 笑笑笑笑笑笑笑笑笑笑笑笑笑笑笑笑!",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The angels laugh at me as the girl in the machine is ruthlessly violated.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I try to move but, once again, I find myself strapped to a chair.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess you don’t want to fuck me after all.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That makes sense.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry for asking.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hahahahahah! Truly a tragedy!",
      "spk": "Angel 1",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes! Yes! Cucked by a machine! Such a weak human!",
      "spk": "Angel 2",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene warning2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/Warning2.png",
      "alt": "warning2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "For a moment, I remember this is all a game.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "jump howifeelx",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label howifeelx:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I think back to months ago when I first dreamt of having sex with my [niece].",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "How many times have I had that dream since then?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
