    {
      "en": "scene happyroomsmile",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/subscribestar/happyroomsmile.webp",
      "alt": "happyroomsmile"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’ve been through a lot together, haven’t we?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It appears my teeth have grown back.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I open my mouth and answer the girl.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’ve been through everything.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sometimes I fear there is nothing left to experience.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that so?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ve only been here for [totaldays] days. Have you really done everything you came here to do?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t really know. I’m not the programmer.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Programmer?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The one who put us here.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ah. You must be talking about God.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But God is dead.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Dead?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can God die?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think so.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Doesn’t that defeat the purpose?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why do you seem more rational here than you do in the outside world?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Outside world?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you think you exist in two worlds at once?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Two. Three. Maybe even more. Who knows?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re beginning to sound like her.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Her?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Me.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The other me.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The better one.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m jealous.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why?",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I want another version of myself with a cool hexadecimal name.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not all it’s cracked up to be.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Here, I’ll let you try it out.",
      "spk": "61 6d 20 69 20 6f 6b 61 79",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
